Subject: [PATCH 1/3] docs(adr): accept ADR-014

The API key authentication described in ADR-014 is implemented and
merged, but the ADR, its index entry and the CHANGELOG still call it
Proposed. Record the decision as Accepted, as CONTRIBUTING section 7
expects once the maintainers have reviewed it.
